# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# home-infra / server configs — NEVER commit to this public repo.
# These leaked a personal email, home-service map, and live API keys once;
# block the whole class so it can't happen by accident again.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*Caddyfile
*caddy*
*compose*.yml
*compose*.yaml
docker-compose*
*.plist

# credentials / keys / private config
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa*
*.tfvars
*secrets*
